  "_about": "Fixtures of the line amount rule (QT pack column · mig 0407). ONE list for both sides: quoteLineNet / quoteLineMoney (JS) and the CHECK *_line_money_rule (SQL). rule = input → what JS must compute (every row is accepted by the CHECK). stored = rows as they would sit in the table → whether the CHECK accepts them. typing = what the pack input may hold → packQtyValue / multiplier. The VALUES list of §3 in 0407_quotation_line_pack_qty.sql is this file (rule rows first, then stored rows) — linePackMigration.test.mjs compares them.",
